    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 The Ice Fairy who came to Freya after Princess Felicia was turned, she oversees everything in the Frozen Labyrinth on behalf of Freya. She has watched the movements of the Zinnia Guild ever since the Order of Canna Knights disappeared. Spirits Lv. 7 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Spirits. P. Def. +5% Evasion +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sleep +20% M. Def. -5% Accuracy -5 Greater Water Resistance Lv. 5 Very resistant to Water. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
